<title>CHINA: Trading of Fu Hui shares suspended.</title>
<headline>Trading of Fu Hui shares suspended.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in shares of jewellery concern Fu Hui Holdings Ltd was suspended on Tuesday afternoon at the company's request pending an announcement, the Stock Exchange of Hong Kong said.</p>
<p>The stock closed the morning session at HK$1.19, up HK$0.14 on volume of 84.34 million shares.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6369</p>
